sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant BM as BleManager
    participant Q as GattOperationQueue
    participant G as BluetoothGatt
    participant P as Peripheral (lock)

    User->>BM: connect(lockAddress)
    BM->>G: connectGatt (main thread; state machine)
    G-->>BM: onConnectionStateChange(CONNECTED)
    BM->>Q: enqueue(Discover)
    Q->>G: discoverServices()  (one op)
    G-->>Q: onServicesDiscovered -> next
    BM->>Q: enqueue(Write unlock)
    Q->>G: writeCharacteristic()  (wait for prior to finish)
    G->>P: unlock
    G-->>Q: onCharacteristicWrite -> done
    Note over Q,G: concurrent ops would SILENTLY FAIL -> queue serializes + times out
